        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"4869b5e2-7d43-46a9-bab2-ab1e05c538e9\",\"review_text\":\"Used it just for 6 month trial\"},{\"review_id\":\"26fe2b54-8a60-499b-95c0-508d31a56e81\",\"review_text\":\"very help full\"},{\"review_id\":\"2792d7c9-7489-4fa5-bb7f-d43d9d8616a6\",\"review_text\":\"Best music platform.\"},{\"review_id\":\"51e30e6b-a1f0-491b-b5c4-f43ffd59a5e9\",\"review_text\":\"All the best songs in one platform.\"},{\"review_id\":\"02d97688-6199-4a53-a543-e0dc5e059455\",\"review_text\":\"This is a vdery good music app for your phone . I have never had any problems and it is reasonably priced. I have used this app for about 3 years now . I give it the very best rating its a must have if you love music as I do!\"},{\"review_id\":\"0db711a3-90a6-4a2a-9c89-a52f22c67f83\",\"review_text\":\"Since update. Sometimes i can only play 1 song, can't skip or pick a song further down playlist. Just stops and crashes. Also playlist has shown 2 songs continuously repeating over a dozen times before other songs where listed...\"},{\"review_id\":\"4b41a637-2f80-4883-8164-0167bcc69be1\",\"review_text\":\"Love this\"},{\"review_id\":\"70c10706-cb1c-4623-9c21-bf303e1e6ebe\",\"review_text\":\"Charged me for subscription even though I tried cancelling it 50 times this is the worst app ever DO NOT DOWN!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"6eab2fd8-eef3-47be-91fd-1d7704cb20a3\",\"review_text\":\"Listening to music for 60yeers! Best app ever. Please don't stop what you are doing!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"7b4f5e5f-a404-4c7f-8435-57752a824432\",\"review_text\":\"World chepest app it os ao weird 🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤢🤢🤢🤢🤢🤢🤢🤢🤢🤢😠😠😡😠😡😠😡😠😡😠😠😤😤😤😤😤😤😤😤😤😤\"}]}"
